@GbAccount.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5025

### Chart of accounts (full list)
GET {{GbAccount.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Chart of accounts (paged, scoped to one organization)
GET {{GbAccount.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts?orgId=220&page=1&pageSize=50
Accept: application/json

### One account
GET {{GbAccount.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/1
Accept: application/json

### Account categories
GET {{GbAccount.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Organizations
GET {{GbAccount.Api_HostAddress}}/api/organizations
Accept: application/json

### Active organizations only
GET {{GbAccount.Api_HostAddress}}/api/organizations?activeOnly=true
Accept: application/json

###
